   {
    "title": "Shift the variable",
    "body": "$\\int_{2012}^{2014}(x-2013)^2dx=\\int_{-1}^{1}u^2du=\\frac23$ and $\\int_{2012}^{2014}(x-2015)^2dx=\\int_{-3}^{-1}u^2du=\\frac{27-1}3=\\frac{26}3$. Sum: $\\frac{28}3$.\n\n**Answer: $\\frac{28}3$**"
   }
